---
description: Project architecture rules (always on)
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow @AGENTS.md exactly. It is the single source of truth for structure, RBAC, errors, logging and tests.

- Create modules only with `uv run dx new-module <service> <name>`; never hand-create module files.
- Never edit `packages/platform-kit`, `.github/` or the root `pyproject.toml`.
- After editing, run `uv run dx check <file>` and fix every reported code before continuing.
- Definition of done: `uv run dx fmt && uv run dx lint --service <s> && uv run dx test --service <s>`.
